  "segments": [
    {
      "line": 1,
      "text": "1.前往法兰城（156.102）处，大于等于Lv.8的士兵职业与士兵长欧里对话，选“是”获得【讨伐哥布林的勋章】。",
      "type": "career-item-acquisition",
      "sourceLines": [
        1
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 2,
      "text": "◆若队伍人数不足5人，则无法接任务；后续步骤无需保持队伍人数",
      "type": "party-size-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        2
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 3,
      "text": "◆【讨伐哥布林的勋章】：Lv.1项链、耐久95~115；闪躲+1~2、魅力+1~2；装备后获得称号“哥布林讨伐队”；不可交易",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        3
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 4,
      "text": "2.出法兰城南门，前往芙蕾雅岛（437.308）处，通过黄色传送石抵达哥布林之家。",
      "type": "maze-entry",
      "sourceLines": [
        4
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 5,
      "text": "◆哥布林之家为随机迷宫，随机3~4层",
      "type": "maze-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        5
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 6,
      "text": "迷宫刷新时间：4小时（仅供参考），地图大小范围：100*100~150*150",
      "type": "maze-metadata",
      "sourceLines": [
        6
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 7,
      "text": "宝箱数量：4",
      "type": "treasure-count",
      "sourceLines": [
        7
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 8,
      "text": "魔物为Lv.3~9哥布林、红帽哥布林，最高遇敌数量8",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        8
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 9,
      "text": "3.在迷宫内寻找随机出现正确的哥布林，大于等于Lv.8的士兵职业与之对话，交出【讨伐哥布林的勋章】，全队获得【红色三菱镜】。",
      "type": "party-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        9
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 10,
      "text": "◆迷宫内存在多个哥布林，若与错误的对话会进入战斗，且有时为两连战；",
      "type": "wrong-npc-battle",
      "sourceLines": [
        10
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 11,
      "text": "◆迷宫刷新后，之前拿的【红色三菱镜】作废",
      "type": "maze-reset-rule",
      "sourceLines": [
        11
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 12,
      "text": "◆全队都需持有【红色三菱镜】",
      "type": "party-item-gate",
      "sourceLines": [
        12
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 13,
      "text": "4.通过随机迷宫抵达哥布林之家底层到达哥布林之家4楼，通过红色传送石（10.15，交出【红色三菱镜】通过栅栏。",
      "type": "party-item-consumption",
      "sourceLines": [
        13
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 14,
      "text": "◆哥布林之家4楼：固定地图，魔物：Lv.10~12哥布林、红帽哥布林",
      "type": "encounter-area",
      "sourceLines": [
        14
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 15,
      "text": "5.与哥布林枪手（9.5）对话，进入战斗。",
      "type": "battle-step",
      "sourceLines": [
        15
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 16,
      "text": "◆战斗信息：",
      "type": "battle-heading",
      "sourceLines": [
        16
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 17,
      "text": "Lv.13~15哥布林枪手，血量约700，2动，邪魔系，属性：火70风30，抗咒；技能：攻击、防御、连击、战栗袭心",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        17
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 18,
      "text": "Lv.12~14哥布林*2，血量约300；技能：攻击、防御、逃跑、什么都不做",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        18
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 19,
      "text": "Lv.13~14红帽哥布林，血量约300；技能：攻击、防御、连击",
      "type": "battle-enemy",
      "sourceLines": [
        19
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 20,
      "text": "6.战斗胜利后，队伍中随机一人获得【橘色头盔】，并且切换场景。",
      "type": "battle-reward",
      "sourceLines": [
        20
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 21,
      "text": "◆【橘色头盔】：Lv.1头盔、耐久5~10；防御+1~2、敏捷-1、命中-1、魅力-5~-10；不可交易",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        21
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 22,
      "text": "7.解散队伍，调查宝箱（5.5），随机获得【奖品】并且全队传送至芙蕾雅岛（437.308）处。",
      "type": "solo-chest",
      "sourceLines": [
        22
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 23,
      "text": "◆【奖品】：【古钱？】（阿尔卡迪亚古钱）（其他未知）",
      "type": "partial-reward-list",
      "sourceLines": [
        23
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 24,
      "text": "8.返回法兰城与士兵长欧里对话，交出【橘色头盔】获得【头盔？】、【鞋？】，任务完结。",
      "type": "completion-exchange",
      "sourceLines": [
        24
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 25,
      "text": "◆【头盔？】、【鞋？】鉴定后为【士兵头盔】、【士兵鞋】",
      "type": "identification-note",
      "sourceLines": [
        25
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 26,
      "text": "【士兵头盔】：Lv.2头盔、耐久250~300；防御+18、敏捷-2~-1；可交易",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        26
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 27,
      "text": "【士兵鞋】：Lv.2鞋、耐久250~300；防御+5~6、敏捷+2；可交易",
      "type": "reward-detail",
      "sourceLines": [
        27
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 28,
      "text": "装备【士兵头盔】、【士兵鞋】时，获得称号“哥布林讨伐者”",
      "type": "set-title",
      "sourceLines": [
        28
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    },
    {
      "line": 29,
      "text": "◆任务剧情：参考《讨伐哥布林任务剧情对话》",
      "type": "story-reference",
      "sourceLines": [
        29
      ],
      "verification": {
        "status": "verified",
        "method": "manual-semantic-review"
      }
    }
  ],
